       EEIINNTTRR  The pause has been interrupted by a signal that was delivered to
              the  thread  (see ssiiggnnaall(7)).  The remaining sleep time has been
              written into _*_r_e_m so that the thread can easily call nnaannoosslleeeepp()
              again and continue with the pause.

